# {version}

## Setup
```python
bazel_dep(name = "rules_kconfig", version = "{version}")
```

## Parser builds

Kconfig repositories are generated by the kernel's Kconfig parser, which the
`kconfig` extension of this release downloads; no Python interpreter is
needed. On Bazel 9.3 or newer with `--experimental_repository_ctx_execute_wasm`
it runs as `kconfig.wasm` (attached here, integrity `{module_integrity}`);
elsewhere as the native build for the host, attached here as
`kconfig_tool-<os>-<cpu>`:

{tool_integrities}

Additional documentation can be found at: https://github.com/periareon/rules_kconfig
